\"project-info\">\n                        <h2 class=\"project-title-name\">Mr. Vijay Singh </h2>\n                        <p>SONIPAT</p>\n                        <a title=\"View Mr Vijay Singh residence interior design project\" href=\"/chhattarpur/vijay-residence-interior-design\" class=\"view-more-button-link\">View More</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Project Card 13: Mr. Vijay Singh Sonipat -->\n                <div class=\"project-card\">\n                    <div class=\"img-container\">\n                        <img width=\"1709\" height=\"2560\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/hannu-office/dsc-4479.avif\" alt=\"Hannu corporate office interior design\" title=\"Hannu corporate office interior design\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"project-info\">\n                        <h2 class=\"project-title-name\">Mr. Aseem Jain </h2>\n                        <p></p>\n                        <a title=\"View Hannu corporate office interior design project\" href=\"/chhattarpur/hannu-office\" class=\"view-more-button-link\">View More</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Project Card 14: Mr. Vijay Singh Sonipat -->\n                <div class=\"project-card\">\n                    <div class=\"img-container\">\n                        <img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/luxuria/4u0a6650a.avif\" alt=\"Luxuria luxury apartment interior design\" title=\"Luxuria luxury apartment interior design\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"project-info\">\n                        <h2 class=\"project-title-name\">Luxuria </h2>\n                        <p></p>\n                        <a title=\"View Luxuria luxury apartment interior design project\" href=\"/chhattarpur/luxuria-interior-design\" class=\"view-more-button-link\">View More</a>\n                    <